### Create a deposit
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 1000,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

### Create another deposit (EUR)
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 500,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "type": "deposit"
}

### Create a transfer
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 250,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### Create a withdrawal
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 100,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "withdrawal"
}

### List all transactions
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions

### Filter by account
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345

### Filter by type
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?type=transfer

### Get account balance
GET http://localhost:3000/accounts/ACC-12345/balance

### Get account summary
GET http://localhost:3000/accounts/ACC-12345/summary

### Export as CSV
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions/export?format=csv

### Test validation error (invalid amount and currency)
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": -50,
  "currency": "INVALID",
  "type": "transfer"
}
